flowchart TB
    P["Step 1: Plan<br/>12 to 48 hours before departure"] --> C["Step 2: Check<br/>the verdict and the lanes"]
    C --> D{"Step 3: Decide<br/>worst level on the route?"}
    D -- "Low or Moderate" --> B["Step 4: Brief the driver<br/>route, arrival, stretches to watch"]
    D -- "High or worse" --> W["Try a later departure<br/>or another route"]
    W --> C
    B --> R["Step 5: Re-plan<br/>at departure, when it slips,<br/>every 6 hours on long trips"]
    R --> C
